					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This part of Incident Zero was on hold for months to years because I wanted to showcase cool stuff from the international sites.</p> <p>Because that didn't really work out the way I planned, I took advantage of the opening of the new international showcase and picked a few articles I thought seemed cool.</p> <p>Apologies to everyone whom I failed to please on this one, and double apologies if I got the nature of the SCPs wrong.</p> 
